    {
      "name": "gui_observe",
      "description": "Get a screenshot plus its width, height, pixel units, origin and coordinate axes. Coordinates are integer pixels in the original screenshot, with top-left origin (0, 0). x increases right and y increases down. Use the screenshot width and height; coordinates are not percentages or a normalized 0-1000 scale. Optionally save an immutable named reference for expect_image; choose a new name for each capture.",
